  "media_scope": "Six movie controls, up to three normal published SwiftFlow -> BlinkFlux playback flows each, then FastFlux. No downloaded JS executed: parse literal encrypted payload/IV and follow the explicitly published requestUnlock empty-token POST. These are ordinary player handoffs, not the separately Turnstile-gated Movix SwiftFlux resolve endpoint. Per-title timings in this phase are not alternated; API-only phase is alternated. At most two concurrent titles. Prefix reads capped at4096 bytes, first round only; signed URLs/grants and payloads stay in memory.",
